    {"court": "Hatti", "entry": "k11 T2, k19 T4 sealed (peace; Ugarit in Hatti's reach; word before quarrel). Hatti holds Ugarit (fleet). T7: Hatti would not seal a strike tablet, promises no gold or ships, will send word of Egyptian fleets and asked the same of me. My 150-per-province offer stands, nothing paid. T9 plan: c13 asks F ugarit to support Amurru's walls and joins a plan against Egypt's Cyprus fleets."}
