    {"court": "Alashiya", "entry": "T4 I took Enkomi and Tamassos. Owe them nothing. Never sealed anything with them. T8: army takes Amurru (their last land), which ends their kingdom."},
    {"court": "Hatti", "entry": "T3 sealed k26 (no troops against each other; Egypt holds Byblos etc; Hatti holds Ugarit, Carchemish, Isuwa; Amurru/Qadesh need other's word). T7 refused Keliya's tablet barring me from Ugarit, Carchemish, Cilician Sea. T7 sent c16 (arrives T9, back ~T11) offering: Egypt keeps Byblos, Amurru, Cyprus, south; Hatti keeps Ugarit; no troops against each other. No gold. T8 I take Amurru without Hatti's word. Hold off on Ugarit until their reply. c2 back T9."},
