  "notes": "T8: Treasury 0 (Ubaru took 22 back pay). Net +20 a season before wages, so only ONE paid envoy is affordable (c9 Pirissi, 10 a season, back about T9). Ubaru (c18) asked 12; I did NOT renew: sent him on a last mission to Babylonia (arrives T9, back T10), then he is paid back pay and leaves unless I renew. Letter: peace on present borders, brotherly gift, no tablet (scribe 20 not affordable now), no gold. Defence changed: ashur supports arbela, arbela supports ashur, nineveh now supports ASHUR (capital hold 3, arbela hold 2; safer if Babylon and Mitanni ever join against the capital). Geometry: Ekallatum attack is capped at 3 (ashur, arbela, Terqa) vs Babylon hold 3, so it cannot succeed unless Babylon thins out. Terqa/Taidu: I cannot support any move into them, but an EMPTY Terqa or Taidu can be walked into by ashur/nineveh (hold 0). Never leave Ashur empty beside Ekallatum. Wake triggers set on moves in terqa, taidu, ekallatum, susa and the return of c9, c18. T9 plan: receive c9, read Egypt news, decide whether to send c9 to Hatti (peace tablet, urge them on Mitanni) or Egypt; seal tablets once treasury has 20+. Do not hire c10/c15.",
