{
  "notes": "T8 orders: chain shift. Fleet ugarit->cilicia, army carchemish->ugarit, army kanesh->carchemish, raise army in kanesh (empty only if the chain works; else nothing paid). Tuwanuwa holds with hattusa + kizzuwatna support (hold 3 vs Arzawa max 3 = bounce). Spy c4 at mira shows APASA (Arzawa capital, 40) EMPTY; Arzawa armies at lukka, mira, seha (fleet probably westsea). T9 PLAN: take Lukka: kizzuwatna army moves to lukka, tuwanuwa army + fleet at cilicia support (3 v hold 2, or 3 if their fleet supports). New kanesh army + hattusa support tuwanuwa holding. Never leave tuwanuwa or kizzuwatna empty. If Lukka falls: lukka army -> apasa (empty), then seha/mira. Bounces cost nothing. Qadesh (Babylon, walled) tempting but I promised Egypt no troops vs Amurru/Qadesh; Isuwa promised to Mitanni: do not break yet. Treasury about 7 after raise; T9 net +40 with 6 armies + fleet (income 255, upkeep 215). c3 Keliya back T9: use him as courier. Consider hiring c10 (25) at T9 if gold allows. Watch Egypt fleet in syriansea next to Ugarit.",
  "summary": "Suppiluliuma of Hatti. Aim: highest growth vs start 2100 (strength = 10 x yields + gold - back pay). T8: strength 2619 (1.25), treasury 107, yield 255 (hattusa, tuwanuwa, sapinuwa, kanesh, kizzuwatna, ugarit, carchemish), 5 armies + fleet, income 255, upkeep 185. Egypt leads 2.08, Babylon 1.64, me 1.42, Arzawa 1.25, Mitanni 1.21, Assyria 0.81, Alashiya 0.24. All free cities are taken, so growth now only by conquest. Sealed and standing: k6/k31 Alashiya (Ugarit Hatti's; no Hatti ships vs Enkomi/Tamassos); k12 and k43 Egypt (Egypt may take Amurru and Qadesh, Hatti Ugarit and Carchemish; I promised no troops or buying vs Amurru/Qadesh); k21, k30, k42 Mitanni (Carchemish, Ugarit, Lukka Hatti's; Isuwa Mitanni's; no armies into each other's homeland); k22 Arzawa broken by Arzawa at once: never trust Arzawa. Assyria offered alliance vs Mitanni T3, nothing sealed. Walled bought cities: take with mover + 1 support. Main target: Arzawa (apasa 40, seha 30, mira 30, lukka 25 = 125 yield, 1250 strength). Gateway is Lukka (adjacent to my tuwanuwa and kizzuwatna armies, fleets at cilicia). Apasa seen empty at T8. Tuwanuwa needs hold 3 vs Arzawa max 3 (supporters only hattusa, kanesh, kizzuwatna). People: c3 Keliya (back T9 from Egypt, owed 24), c4 Artessupa spy at mira (14 a season through T9). Free candidates c10 (25), c15 (30). Later targets if Arzawa falls: Isuwa/Harran (Mitanni), Qadesh (Babylon), Egypt's Levant cities.",
  "ledger": [
    {"court": "Arzawa", "entry": "T4: k22 sealed but Arzawa broke it the same turn (took Seha, struck Tuwanuwa). Never trust its tablets. Holds Apasa, Lukka, Mira, Seha. T8: my spy c4 at Mira sees Apasa empty; armies at lukka, mira, seha. I plan to take Lukka T9 (Mitanni k21 and k30 grant it to Hatti; Lukka is not Arzawa homeland, so k7 does not forbid it). No gold. Nothing owed."}
