{
  "notes": "T8: Mane (Mitanni) accepted division B in words (Nineveh+Mari to M., Ashur+Arbela to me) but sealed nothing, cannot bind Terqa, day not before T10. I send c6 to Mitanni (arrives T9, back T10) with my tablet, 50 gold, mandate to name the day: proposed T11 (T10 only if Tushratta says his orders are already given). STRIKE PLAN (only when Mitanni confirmed and I am awake with c6's report): ekallatum->ashur (terqa supports), susa->arbela, taidu->nineveh, durkurigalzu->ekallatum refill (sippar and mari support the refill). Ashur hold is then 1 because arbela and nineveh supports are cut. RISK: if terqa does not support, my ekallatum army can be dislodged by arbela+ashur(+terqa). Never strike blind. After Ashur falls: ashur supports susa->arbela; Mitanni takes Nineveh with my help from ashur. Mari: promised to Mitanni only after Ashur+Arbela are mine and Assyria is finished; keep the option to delay (Mitanni in Mari would touch Sippar). Spies: c5 to Assyria's court (copy tablets: any Assyria-Mitanni pact?), c17 to province taidu (sees taidu, washukanni, nineveh). c5 not renewed, leaves when back. Hatti outreach postponed to T10: brotherhood tablet covering Qadesh and Mari. If Mitanni stalls or lies: hold the ring, save gold (+125 a season), scout Terqa/Harran before any move on Terqa (breaks k8). No free cities remain: growth now only by conquest. Egypt leads at 2.08; I need Assyria, then maybe Mitanni, to catch it.",
  "summary": "Burna-Buriash of Babylonia, start strength 2600; T8 strength 3627 (1.40), treasury 427, income 320, upkeep 150 (5 armies: ekallatum, sippar, durkurigalzu, susa, mari), wages 45. Egypt leads 2.08 (land 395), Hatti 1.42, Arzawa 1.25, Mitanni 1.21, Assyria 0.81, Alashiya 0.24. All free city-states are gone (Egypt took Byblos T7, Hatti took Carchemish); growth now only by conquest or saving gold. I hold babylon, sippar, durkurigalzu, nippur, ur, ekallatum, susa, mari, qadesh (walled, no troops, mari can support its walls). Tablets: k8 (T2 Mitanni: no troops into each other's homeland), k28 (T3 Egypt brotherhood), k32 (T4 Mitanni: Nineveh to Mitanni, Arbela+Ashur to me, no separate peace with Assyria). Assyria (arbela, ashur, nineveh) is a mutual-support triangle: a support is cut by an attack from any province other than the one supported into; I can only crack it with a Mitanni supporter (terqa or nineveh side). Ring: ekallatum holds, sippar+durkurigalzu+mari support it (hold 4, enemy max 3). T8: Mitanni envoy Mane accepted division B in words (Nineveh+Mari to M.) but sealed nothing; I sent c6 with a tablet and 50 gold to fix the strike day (proposed T11). Mitanni's Terqa army backed Assyria in T6; treat Tushratta as unreliable. People: c6 Kidin-Adad (11, term T12), c17 Ehli-Teshub (21, term T13), c5 Piyamaradu (Arzawa-born, unrenewed, sent as spy). c15 Mazipalali (26) not hired. Wake T10.",
  "ledger": [
    {
      "court": "Mitanni",
      "entry": "k8 (T2), k32 (T4) sealed. T8: Mane brought a tablet for division 1 (Ashur+Nineveh to M.); I refused to seal. I took division 2 (Nineveh+Mari to M., Ashur+Arbela to me); Mane committed in words, no seal, cannot bind Terqa, day not before T10. T8 I sent c6 with my own tablet, 50 gold, mandate to name the day (proposed T11). Mari owed only after Ashur+Arbela are mine and Assyria is finished. T6 Terqa backed Assyria; T7 Mitanni did not move. k8/k32 cover homelands only."
    },
